$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Preparation of propionic
acid-(R)-3-iodoethyl-1-phenethylbut-3-enyl ester. To a stirring solution
of the ester (116.9 mg, 0.416 mmol, 1.00 eq) and acetone (4.2 mL, 0.10 M)
in a 25 mL round-bottom flask at room temperature was added NaI (1.25 g,
8.32 mmol, 20 eq). The mixture was kept at room temperature in the dark
for 24 h and then diluted with Et2O (15 mL). The mixture was filtered
through a plug of Celite®, the filtrate was diluted with Et2O (50 mL) and
filtered through the same plug of Celite®. The filtrate was concentrated
under reduced pressure and the residue was purified by flash
chromatography on a 1.5 x 18 cm silica gel column eluting with a solvent
gradient of 2.5% (100 mL) through 5% EtOAc/hexanes (100 mL). The eluant
was collected in 10 mL portions and the product containing fractions (6
to 12) were combined and concentrated.
((2S,6R)-6-benzyloxymethyl-4-methylenetetrahydro-pyran-2-yl)-acetic acid
(S)-1-[2-(tert-butyl-diphenyl-silanyloxy)-ethyl]-3-iodomethyl-but-3-enyl
ester as a clear colorless oil, yield 44.8 mg, 59.5 μmol, 99%. Rf 0.85
(25% EtOAc/hexanes); [α]20D +11.4 (c = 1.516, CHCl3); 500 MHz 1H NMR
(CDCl3) δ 7.68 - 7.65 (m, 4H), 7.45 -7.26 (m, 11H), 5.32 - 5.27 (m, 1H),
5.26 (s, 1H), 4.93 (s, 1H), 4.77 (d, J = 1.7 Hz, 1H), 4.74 (d, J = 1.7
Hz, 1H), 4.54 (s, 2H), 3.99 (d, J = 9.4 Hz, 1H), 3.90 (d, J = 9.4 Hz,
1H), 3.73 - 3.67 (m, 3H), 3.54 - 3.46 (m, 2H), 3.42 (dd, J = 9.6, 4.3 Hz,
1H), 2.64 - 2.55 (m, 2H), 2.44 (dd, J = 14.8, 8.6 Hz, 1H), 2.38 (dd, J =
15.2, 6.2 Hz, 1H), 2.30 - 2.24 (m, 2H), 2.03 (dd, J = 12.6, 12.6 Hz, 1H),
1.95 (dd, J = 12.4, 12.4 Hz, 1H), 1.85 - 1.80 (m, 2H), 1.06 (s, 9H); 125
MHz 13C NMR (CDCl3) δ 170.5, 143.4, 143.0, 138.5, 135.8 (2), 135.8 (2),
133.8, 133.7, 129.9 (2), 128.6 (2), 127.9 (6), 127.8, 116.9, 109.8, 77.7,
75.1, 73.6, 73.1, 69.6, 60.3, 41.8, 40.5, 39.4, 37.3, 37.1, 27.1 (3),
19.4, 10.6; 125 MHz DEPT (CDCl3) δ CH3: 27.1 (3). CH2: 116.9, 109.8,
73.6, 73.1, 60.3, 41.8, 40.5, 39.4, 37.3, 37.1, 10.6. CH: 135.8 (2),
135.8 (2), 129.9 (2), 128.6 (2), 127.9 (6), 127.8, 77.7, 75.1, 69.6. C:
170.5, 143.4, 143.0, 138.5, 133.8, 133.7, 19.4; IR (neat) 3070, 3030,
2955, 2931, 2891, 2857, 1737, 1652, 1634, 1589, 1472, 1428, 1389, 1362,
1328, 1259, 1217, 1191, 1156, 1111, 1028, 998, 973, 904, 823, 738, 702,
614 cm-1; HRMS (CI) Calcd for C39H50IO5Si m/z (M+H): 753.2472. Found:
753.2487.
